    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2748,
        "endIndex": 3187,
        "text": "#### **[14] US Pentagon deploys ChatGPT Mil and Grok for Government on GenAI.mil platform**\n* **What is confirmed:** On August 31, 2026, the US Department of Defense officially added OpenAI’s \"ChatGPT Mil\" and xAI/Starshield’s \"Grok for Government\" to its secure GenAI.mil portal, offering Impact Level 5 (Controlled Unclassified Information) accredited AI tools to 3 million military and civilian personnel alongside Google’s Gemini"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        15,
        16,
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3189,
        "endIndex": 3349,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** Anthropic’s Claude remains excluded from the portal following a supply-chain risk designation stemming from safety guardrail disputes"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        18,
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3395,
